(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "60b5536b-d60a-40e6-81bc-cc2913735208"))
(text "GPIO numbers are those of include/board_pins.h. GPIO35 (second receiver) and GPIO19 (second emitter) are reserved, not connected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 213.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "70346729-0c4c-4275-838a-333d280921be"))
(text "Buttons are active low: internal pull-ups, no external resistors. The five switches share one ground line." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 219.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "34dc28ad-f44e-465c-985b-01c0155d34b7"))
(text "Power: the switch sits before the XL6009, so the divider stops draining the cell when the unit is off. Charge only with the switch off (no power path)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 224.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ed52a45f-4756-4a27-8cea-8901a94e9a12"))
(text "Emitter: about 34 mA per LED was calculated from the resistor values, not measured. The TSAL6200 is rated 100 mA continuous." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 230.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "49f83dca-10d9-4335-9bab-2e2a08453361"))
(text "Pin order of the OLED, the microSD module and the TSOP varies between parts: read the silkscreen. TSOP38238 seen from the dome side, legs down: 1 OUT, 2 GND, 3 VS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 235.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8d7da554-b661-4bc4-b518-0c33dcbc531f"))
(text "The battery divider needs the firmware option IRIS_BATTERY_RATIO_PERMILLE=2000 (set in the esp32dev_ssd1306 environment)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 241.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6c2342a1-9642-4b33-9f2c-321755dcc01d")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
